  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Integrate Leading AI Models Into Processes",
    "splashDescription": "Amazon Bedrock is a fully managed service that allows teams to experiment with and evaluate foundation models (FMs) from leading AI companies. With Bedrock, you can privately customize FMs with your own data and build agents that execute tasks using your enterprise systems and data sources. The Bedrock Connector makes it easy to integrate AI models into business processes that are orchestrated by Camunda. The Connector enables you to send requests to any model that Bedrock manages in your region.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/449589/overview/img1518293777993457878.png?32b7b863536c50bcd4cdb33d33f309df",
